# Build context hygiene. Without this the context is ~2 GB — the archive
# folders alone dwarf the source — and every build ships them to the
# daemon before the first instruction runs.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# Secrets. Belt and braces: .env is gitignored too, but a build context is
# built from the filesystem, not from git, so a local .env WOULD be copied
# in without this line.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Source archives — gitignored, large, and never needed to build.
BRS/
BRS ExCom/
logo/
mars-rover-frame/

.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
*.log
